# Before writing or changing music, read music/README.md (style, moods, format).
# Built after the title song (music/title.scrim). The waltz kept, moved to E Phrygian (A minor's
# notes), the flute opening on the toy tune (E F G B A), celesta arpeggios with added seconds, vibes
# on the second beat.
title    Frozen
composer Claude
about    Blue ice and still lakes under the ground, after the glass bird: a slow waltz in E Phrygian (the title's notes, on E), a low flute opening on the toy tune (E F G, B A, G), celesta arpeggios with added seconds, a vibraphone on the second beat, glass harmonica chords and a low fretless bass; the bird calls at the phrase ends. When something is near, a cracked crystal ostinato ticks over a glass heartbeat, a rim and a triangle; a kit and the tune come back as it comes for you, a horn, drive and breaking glass for a fight, choir and gong for a guardian.
tempo    72
beats    3
steps    4
reverb   0.45

# moods (music/README.md)
# mood explore:  lead vibes ost pad bass bird
# mood treasure: ost pad bird wonder
# mood sense:    crack heart rim tri pad bass bowl
# mood rise:     sense -bowl lead kick snare
# mood fight:    rise -heart -tri horn drive war smash
# mood boss:     fight -lead choir gong

voice lead     flute      vol=0.62 pan=-0.1 rev=0.5
voice vibes    vibes      vol=0.32 pan=0.3
voice ost      celesta    vol=0.34 pan=-0.3 rev=0.6
voice pad      glassharp  vol=0.2  pan=-0.25 center=A3 att=0.4 rel=0.8
voice bass     fretless   vol=0.7  glide=0.08
voice bird     crystal    vol=0.5  pan=0.4  rev=0.7
voice wonder   crystal    vol=0.28 pan=-0.35 rev=0.6
voice crack    crystal    vol=0.4  pan=-0.3
voice heart    glasstap   vol=0.3  pan=0.1
voice rim      rim        vol=0.32 pan=0.3
voice tri      tri        vol=0.26 pan=-0.4
voice bowl     bowl       vol=0.28 pan=0.15 rev=0.6
voice kick     kick       vol=0.5
voice snare    snare      vol=0.36 pan=0.1
voice horn     horn       vol=0.7  pan=0.2  oct=-1 att=0.025 rel=0.12 rev=0.3
voice drive    pizz       vol=0.5  pan=-0.35 gate=0.55 rev=0.3
voice war      tommid     vol=0.5  pan=0.15 rev=0.2
voice smash    shatter    vol=0.35 pan=-0.2
voice choir    voices     vol=0.28 center=D3 att=0.5 rel=0.8
voice gong     gong       vol=0.3  pan=-0.3

# Em Em F F Dm Dm Em Em: the toy tune
pattern A
lead    | E5----- F5- G5--- | B5------- A5--- | G5----------- | .----------- |
lead    | E5----- F5- G5--- | C6------- B5--- | A5----- G5- F5--- | E5----------- |
horn    | E5!----- F5- G5--- | B5!------- A5--- | G5!----------- | .----------- |
