# Am Am F F G G F Em: the Phrygian fall F to E
pattern B
lead    | C5------- E5--- | A5------- G5--- | F5------- A5--- | C6----------- |
lead    | B5------- G5--- | D5------- G5--- | A5--- G5--- F5--- | E5------- .--- |
horn    | C5!------- E5--- | A5!------- G5--- | F5!------- A5--- | C6!----------- |
